        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Progonat, Tepelenë, Gjirokastër County, Albania\n- Organizations: Kurvelesh municipality, Tepelenë municipality\n- Concepts: 2015 local government reform\n- Natural features: Vjosa River, Drino River\n\nFacts:\n- Progonat is a village in the former Kurvelesh municipality in Gjirokastër County.\n- In the 2015 local government reform, Progonat became part of the municipality of Tepelenë.\n- Tepelenë is a town and a municipality in Gjirokastër County in southern Albania.\n- The town of Tepelenë is on the left bank of the Vjosa River, about three kilometres downstream from its confluence with the Drino River.",
